{1600}{Hi @pcname@ . I am your Spirit Guide. My circle of life is complete but you must continue to live and fight a great evil. You are the only one that can hear me and the only one that can see me. I have been sent here to help you. }{Hi @pcname@ . I am your Spirit Guide. My circle of life is complete but you must continue to live and fight a great evil. You are the only one that can hear me and the only one that can see me. I have been sent here to help you. }{}{}{}{}
{1601}{What ? How can you help me ?}{}{1}{}{1602}{}
{1602}{When you are ready at level 1,10,20,30,40,50 I will offer to you my help. Read the book of bonuses for more details. You can always find me here at the old Panarii crypt. I am going to help you when you are ready.}{When you are ready at level 1,10,20,30,40,50 I will offer to you my help. Read the book of bonuses for more details. You can always find me here at the old Panarii crypt. I am going to help you when you are ready.}{}{}{}{}
{1603}{But I have some questions.}{}{1}{}{1604}{}
{1604}{None of your questions will be answered @pcname@ .You will only find the truth when you go to the other side. Please do not ask any more questions. Just accept my help.}{None of your questions will be answered @pcname@ .You will only find the truth when you go to the other side. Please do not ask any more questions. Just accept my help.}{}{}{}{}
{1605}{Ok then. I will read the book and ask for a bonus.}{}{1}{}{0}{gv 1210 1}
